  id: invoice
  title: 1. Customer Declined Service
  region: Cinder Flats
  briefing: Recover a runaway customer's vehicle. Follow the collection truck into
    Half-Price Horizon Salvage, clear its armed friends, recover the finance ledger
    and return to the shop.
  opening: 'Mara: Customer states the repair was optional. The front wheel was attached
    with a hose clamp. Follow his collection truck; we need the registration.'
  midpoint: 'Mara: These aren''t repossession orders. Sunsprawl is buying cooling
    infrastructure, roads and everyone''s vehicle debt. Take that ledger.'
  closing: 'Mara: We survived a private-security junkyard to collect one hundred
    seventy-three dollars. Including shop supplies.'
  optionalObjective: Cause 8 pieces of collateral damage
